category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-28T17:50:40-08:00","id":1504093,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1504090#post1504090\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Azur Lane, actually. Started playing when I was assigned to Lost-In-The-Woods, Misery (Fort Leonard Wood, Missouri) - the characters were endearing, the navy trivia was interesting, and the voice lines were a good balm against loneliness and a godawful commander. I stopped playing once it became clear they were leaning <i>hard</i> into the fanservice. Still, the Children's Day ships are <i>adorable. </i><span style=\"font-size:8px\">At least until the fanart gets creepy. That's another big reason I stopped. &gt;_&gt;</span>\u200b<br /> <br /> Just look at them!<br /> <img width=\"216\" height=\"190\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://azurlane.netojuu.com/images/7/72/Littl