name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-26T10:37:58-07:00","id":1521434,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1521431#post1521431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To borrow a phrase from Mike Tyson which in essence is that social media has allowed people to say things that would get them beat up in the real world. A recent example I could think of his some anti-vaxers are trying to tie the recent death of wrestler Bray Wyatt to the Covid vaccine and not the fact the wrestling life could've played a bigger part in his fatal heart attack which being on the road for long periods of time, working with injuries and taking performance enchancing drugs more likely played a bigger part in his death and you know that these folks wouldn't say that shit to the man's family if they saw them in the flesh.<br /> <br /> I haven't followed wrestling for a long time and was shocked by hearing how young he was and whom he was related to and seen his face on some promotional vids. But trying to tie someone's death to insane conspiracy theories is low.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not to mention it must be exhausting to find offense in every thing in the world and try to condemn it with such lack of awareness.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-27T19:23:57-07:00","id":1521491,"title":"","content":"As much as I normally love summer and summer sunsets, I'll be honest and say that Arizona summers are just way too damn hot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm just a trans guy and gaming fan, unabashed hedonist and unusually upbeat nihilist, fairly laid back. He/Him.<br /> <br /> If everything is political, then nothing is!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","name":"Matt Corleone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25920_8.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-28T01:12:52-07:00","id":1521496,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1521431#post1521431\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To borrow a phrase from Mike Tyson which in essence is that social media has allowed people to say things that would get them beat up in the real world. A recent example I could think of this was some anti-vaxers are trying to tie the recent death of wrestler Bray Wyatt to the Covid vaccine and not the fact the wrestling life could've played a bigger part in his fatal heart attack which being on the road for long periods of time, working with injuries and taking performance enchancing drugs more likely played a bigger part in his death and you know that these folks wouldn't say that shit to the man's family if they saw them in the flesh.<br /> <br /> I haven't followed wrestling for a long time and was shocked by hearing how young he was and whom he was related to and seen his face on some promotional vids. But trying to tie someone's death to insane conspiracy theories is very low and we don't know the full details of what was happening to him and even my statement of his death being caused by his time in the business would fall under the same criticism that I called them out on.</div> </div> </div> </div>I had a recently had an encounter with my anti vaxxer cousin in regards to thr death of a local guy I know-<br /> <br /> (Abreviated(<br /> <br /> Him-&quot;isnt it odd that he died so abruptly?&quot;<br /> <br /> Me-&quot;kinda abrupt death is always weird.&quot;<br /> <br /> Him-a load of speculation on his covid shots.<br /> <br /> Me-&quot;i think more likely its to do with him being 65, overweight and a chain smoker...if I was to hazard a guess as to what caused his heart attack......do you even know if he had a shot?&quot;<br /> <br /> Naturally this did nothing to stop his enthusiasm for the idea.<br /> <br /> This sort of stuff incidently is why I think the masqurade is more robust than we imagine. Since objective reality is now irrelevant.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 08-28-2023, 04:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-28T14:58:31-07:00","id":1521538,"title":"","content":"On the Bray Wyatt front it appears he had been dealing with the effects of long Covid that made a preexisting heart condition worse according to his family and with a family history of heart disease that is way more probable then a vaccine jab of which I've had numerous times and suffered no ill effects other then a sore arm for a few days. With a family history of Ashma on my Mom's side and wanting to lower my chances of getting it from some the more potent strains I took the shot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-28T15:19:45-07:00","id":1521546,"title":"","content":"Isn't it unreal that we have all this knowledge at our fingertips Ragged Robin and we still like being in the dark on most matters for all sorts of reasons. The Internet/Social Media has been a boon for the conspiracy theory folks that they have a platform to announce there beliefs and not have to rely on word of mouth to thrive or be challenged by simple things like logic, &quot;common sense&quot;, logicistics, and or how it wouldn't work in the real world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-29T12:44:07-07:00","id":1521614,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1521538#post1521538\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On the Bray Wyatt front it appears he had been dealing with the effects of long Covid that made a preexisting heart condition worse according to his family and with a family history of heart disease that is way more probable then a vaccine jab of which I've had numerous times and suffered no ill effects other then a sore arm for a few days. With a family history of Ashma on my Mom's side and wanting to lower my chances of getting it from some the more potent strains I took the shot.</div> </div> </div> </div>Soon as I was able to I got the vaccine and all the boosters. Sadly, I got covid at the end of 2021, and I just got it again last week. Ugh. I went to a concert with a friend and picked it up there I guess. So far he's fine, and everyone I spoke to before I started showing symptoms is ok too, so it doesn't look like I gave it to anyone else.<br /> <br /> Still, it's been no fun dealing with it this week...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-29T13:09:55-07:00","id":1521617,"title":"","content":"Yikes! You good, Gone?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-29T14:23:36-07:00","id":1521620,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1521617#post1521617\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yikes! You good, Gone?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea, for the most part. Been pretty sinusy and worn out with a bit of a headache and sore throat. Started last Thursday evening, so it was a looong weekend.<br /> <br /> I've been taking some allergy meds, afrin and advil dual action to help with the symptoms.<br /> <br /> Hopefully it'll let up soon...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-29T17:01:53-07:00","id":1521626,"title":"","content":"That sucks Mr. Gone and cases of Covid-19 is creeping up again as the weather gets cooler and we will have to deal with this disease for a long time as it's here to stay.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 08-29-2023, 08:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-30T16:29:00-07:00","id":1521704,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1521626#post1521626\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That sucks Mr. Gone and cases of Covid-19 is creeping up again as the weather gets cooler and we will have to deal with this disease for a long time as it's here to stay.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea, I heard there's a new variant making the rounds. It's no fun to deal with either, but at least I had my boosters and such so it wasn't as bad as it could have been. And yea, unfortunately it seems we're gonna be dealing with this for a loooong time. Ugh..<br /> <br /> Definitely gonna be glad to be over this this though, I hate being sick..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-31T10:32:24-07:00","id":1521761,"title":"","content":"A while back I offered to check over grammar and spelling for an artist I back on Patreon. English isn't their native language, and going over somewhat generic speech bubbles for 4-5 variants of the same base image every week or two wasn't that time consuming.<br /> <br /> It has somehow evolved into me writing up all the dialog for them, including on their several recent, more ambitious 10+ page doujinshi. They seem to have health issues, and so from the start offered to do some free illustrations for me in lieu of pay, but I haven't seen hide nor hair of that. At this point it feels like I'm paying them to give me writing assignments...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Membe