m.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-17T12:21:46-07:00","id":1522719,"title":"","content":"It sucks that I can\u2019t seem to find good manga series that really interest me right now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-20T07:02:11-07:00","id":1522826,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1522719#post1522719\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It sucks that I can\u2019t seem to find good manga series that really interest me right now.</div> </div> </div> </div>You know what's even worse than this...? You start a series, a novel, a manga or whatever... you don't get into it, you lose interest. Then a year later or so you pick it up again and for whatever reason, now it just clicks for you and you have a great time. That can be so annoying sometimes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-20T11:53:10-07:00","id":1522843,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1522826#post1522826\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You know what's even worse than this...? You start a series, a novel, a manga or whatever... you don't get into it, you lose interest. Then a year later or so you pick it up again and for whatever reason, now it just clicks for you and you have a great time. That can be so annoying sometimes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Funny how that works sometimes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-20T12:02:51-07:00","id":1522844,"title":"","content":"I don't like the notion of Russell Brand being cancelled from his Youtube channel due to at this point unproven allegations against him when he hasn't had his day in court yet. Maybe I'm being foolish in believing in the concept of Innocent until proven guilty in a court of law.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-21T02:52:01-07:00","id":1522884,"title":"","content":"Because the concept of &quot;Innocent until proven guilty,&quot; is a legal concept to ensure the overwhelming power of government prosecution back by the power of force of arms isn't abused. It's not, and never has, applied to social consequences for the perceptions of actions. We have a right of free association as well, which means not associating with people we think are sex pests, even if that has not met one of the many legal standards of proof out there. Businesses are allowed to deny anyone service unless there's specific laws that would apply (and those pretty much do not cover this situation). <br /> <br /> Also? Accused criminals lose rights. It happens all the time. Their privacy gets invaded so the police can investigate what happened. Their right to speech is constrained (frequently for their own good) so they don't self-incriminate or commit crimes related to interfering with an investigation through speech (ex: witness intimidation). Rights to travel are revoked. Etc. So even by the very strict rules of the courts, serious accusations mean you don't get to live like nothing's happening until the trial is over. This is also why speedy trial rights are important protections for the innocent: so they can get out from under all of the restrictions imposed on them during the determination. Even if you don't want to acknowledge the humans don't actually interact with each other based on court rulings exclusively, if you want to use the standards of the courts, acknowledge the whole system. Being innocent in the eyes of the law doesn't mean you're treated as a normal citizen either.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":2},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-21T14:07:33-07:00","id":1522922,"title":"","content":"Be as that may Heavy Arms, maybe a law should be passed that the media can't name people who are being accused of crimes until they have been formally charged by the Court of Law.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-21T14:30:36-07:00","id":1522924,"title":"","content":"Some countries <i>do</i> do that. Blur faces on camera and the like. I think the US fell on the side of not doing that as a form of accountability (ie we theoretically always know if someone has been detained, so there aren't secret trials), but that is <i>entirely</i> speculation on my part.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude00","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-21T14:46:00-07:00","id":1522925,"title":"","content":"Besides how heavy of an intrusion that is on the freedom of the press in general, what about all the criminals that were only convicted because of media exposure leading to enough evidence when people became aware of something to come forward with? What if a crucial alibi witness that could clear a person's name doesn't realize they have that information because of a media blackout?<br /> <br /> The system as it exists (with all the variations in different jurisdictions), is certainly far from perfect. But plenty of well intentioned laws make things worse instead of better. If fixing things was easy it would already be fixed. It most certainly isn't going to get fixed by focusing on celebrities and how much the public is obsessed with them. The rich, powerful, and well connected are pretty much the last group of people I'm worried about when it comes to any sort of reforms on these topics. Russel Brand is part of the media. He has a platform and resources to defend himself in the court of public opinion as well as the court of law. The vast majority of accused individuals do not, and a media blackout doesn't actually mean jack shit to them, because they're not in the celebrity spotlight in the first place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-21T18:19:42-07:00","id":1522931,"title":"","content":"In relation to the current conversation and as an ongoing gripe of mine in general, dear god I wish people knew and applied Chesterton's Fence more often than they do.<br /> <br /> If you want to change the way things are, first you must understand why it is this way in the first place. What may seem the result of petty arbitration may in fact be a deeper problem where in something is actually working to do quite a lot of good, and the replacement of which may not be as easy as one assumes. For every corrupt or outdated solution there is, there are solutions that are in place because many of the alternatives are worse.<br /> <br /> In the case of Russell Brand, and other such court of public opinions issues, there are legal precedents that may be more productive for certain environments (as Cauthon points out), but the biggest fix isn't rooted in that, but in the idea of fostering a sense of mercy and justice and a willingness to hold and deal out social power as appropriate-you have to help train a populace on the whole to be willing to regard issues as complex, seek out information, know where to cede when they don't have enough, and when to apply when that sometimes doesn't matter.<br /> <br /> And as America goes, you can't do that when you're too busy trying to funnel people into the economic cogwork, the military, or straight into prison. Indeed, you need to cut down on the industrial influence on education as much as possible and build as much onto the philosophic foundation for education if you even want to begin broaching that problem, and that sure as fuck isn't going to happen anytime soon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 09-22-2023, 11:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-22T10:00:24-07:00","id":1522965,"title":"","content":"That's the thing Heavy Arms Russel Brand like Depp have the means to fight against such allegations and the rest of us don't that option and find our lives and reps ruined for the rest of our lives even if the charges were dismissed. Like ArcaneArts has said something needs to change on how we work our legal system and prevent such incidents.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-22T10:14:53-07:00","id":1522966,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1522965#post1522965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's the thing Heavy Arms Russel Brand like Depp have the means to fight against such allegations and the rest of us don't that option and find our lives and reps ruined for the rest of our lives even if the charges were dismissed. Like ArcaneArts has said something needs to change on how we work our legal system and prevent such incidents.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think you misapplied the complaint, given I was actually commenting on your complaint and the lack of Chesterton's Fence being applied to it. What Russel Brand is dealing is preferable to the consequences of your own suggestion, with leeway for discussion.<br /> <br /> Also, I'm tired of people playing the sympathy card for Depp-the outcome of his hearings with Heard are a demonstration of how the law taking a side doesn't actually determine who is right and who is wrong, and even if we take it all as fact, Depp's still been bombing a lot of professional and personal points with his dive back into alcoholism.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 09-22-2023, 01:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":3},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-22T14:18:19-07:00","id":1522979,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1522965#post1522965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's the thing Heavy Arms Russel Brand like Depp have the means to fight against such allegations and the rest of us don't that option and find our lives and reps ruined for the rest of our lives even if the charges were dismissed</div> </div> </div> </div>If you have something in your own experiences to speak on, that's on you to choose to share or not. Fear-mongering about the general &quot;we&quot; doesn't mean you're focusing on the right aspects of the situation.<br /> <br /> I live in a very small town. We don't have our own local paper, we don't have our own local radio, or TV station. Anything that goes on here is a buried a dozen pages in on the papers for bigger population centers nearby. I still know pretty much every public accusation, investigation, or arrest and who's involved because gossip spreads fast. Having more media coverage would actually be useful for the accused because you get the official sourced facts, not fourth hand scuttlebutt from you friend telling you what the local FB &quot;community&quot; page is in a tizzy about. I once had to deal with a month of shit because the local e-fine system broke while I had an injured foot and my weeds got bad enough I got a $50 ticket that had to be hand delivered by one of the town cops. I called about the fact that I had a medical issue, got the fine knocked down to $25, and paid it a few days later. Meanwhile nobody knew what was really going on with the &quot;police investigation&quot; at my house, lots of dumbass rumors got spread, and a few people actually complained to the town council... who then chided them for not reading the public website that the council has where they disclose all fines issued (by address, not name specifically) and if they're pending or resolved. I would have loved a local newspaper covering me instead of waiting for everyone to chill out about the weeds in my yard getting too tall. What would my name being banned from the media talking about do for me? There's still gossip rumblings that happen if a cop comes by my place... even if I'm the one that called them (some idiot kid used my address for a fake ID, lost it, and someone else put it in my mail box, and since it was technically evidence the cops had to come and get it).<br /> <br /> Blurring my face means shit,because everyone around here knows what I look like anyway. Not saying my name doesn't matter, everyone knows my name around here. There's still a few kooks around here convinced something suspicious is happening in my house and fire up local social media groups when they come to my house... even though I'm a community volunteer for their public safety initiative so that happens at least once a year or so when meeting at the station or town building isn't functional.<br /> <br /> So, yeah, I do have a vested interest in getting people to be a bit less nosy, and less judgemental. But I'm also pretty sensitive to ideas that I know don't mean anything good. It's not accusations of sexual assault, but at least one person thinks I was making drugs in my basement. Still, years later, over a fine for yard management. So I feel at least a bit comfortable to be in the &quot;us&quot; you're talking about.<br /> <br /> ------------<br /> <br /> Also, a different point on why the Depp-Heard case is tiring:<br /> <br /> It's a completely great example of the fact that the general public doesn't actually care what the courts say. A court of law found Depp factually liable (it was a civil case) for actions against Heard. But.. lots of people rushed to claim he was innocent despite being proven guilty in court. Depp got his name dragged... and actually did bad things in the eyes of the law... and if you look at the Internet you'd think he was completely vindicated as a matter of law when that's objectively untrue. The public clearly didn't care about innocence or guilt They wanted a winner and a loser. And they picked a winner and a loser even after the court spoke and declared them both guilty of mutually toxic and abusive behavior.<br /> <br /> If your take away from that case is we need to do better at protecting people in Depp's situation's reputations... you lost me. My take away is what we need to do to better balance interests of privacy vs. interests in intervention in domestic abuse cases before they get that bad.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":3},{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-23T10:30:55-07:00","id":1523037,"title":"","content":"It never happened to me Heavy Arms, but it did happen to one of my bosses who got fired from his job because of baseless claims of sexual harrasment and it was because the person who filed the claim was mad that he didn't show any interest in her and didn't want anything to do with her. We told his higher ups that it was false claims and they didn't want to listen to us and they looked really bad when they learned the truth. This happened around 2007.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 09-23-2023, 03:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-23T17:47:26-07:00","id":1523058,"title":"","content":"OK, but what's an actual solution that doesn't make other things worse here? You didn't say that he got fired because the media got involved (or that the media was ignoring employees that were all willing to tell HR that the accusation was BS), so laws changing what the media can say wouldn't have mattered.<br /> <br /> To be frank, I feel like something is missing from your story, because businesses are not in the habit of firing someone over an unsubstantiated accusation; since that opens them to getting sued if the accusation is demonstrated to be malicious and defamatory. I appreciate you might not know, and don't want to speculate, but said higher ups sound like they wanted to fire him, and the accusation was a good way to justify it and screw him out of severance pay (since lots of companies have morality clauses attached to that); hence a clearly insufficient internal review by HR and legal over what the response should be. What your former boss went through isn't what Russel Brand is dealing with though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":2},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-24T11:01:33-07:00","id":1523082,"title":"","content":"This happened when we got new management and they implemented a zero tolerance for sexual harassment claims and didn\u2019t really know how to investigate claims at the time. No media was involved but they were worried about it happening and they barrelled ahead and fired him. When it was discovered that it was baseless they learned that maybe talking to the all parties involved and see what is up and gather proof of such things would be a good plan.<br /> <br /> Our new managers wanted to come across as decisive in such matters and it backfired.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 09-24-2023, 07:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-24T12:55:18-07:00","id":1523091,"title":"","content":"So... you do see how this isn't really about some sort of problem with accusations of sexual harassment specifically? The whole reason Arc brought up Chesteron's Fence was about actually understanding the nature of what's wrong so good solutions can be worked on instead of knee-jerk solutions (that might not really be solutions).<br /> <br /> A new upper management team that wants to crack down on [bad behavior X] to show how decisive they are, and oversteps to the point of ruining an employee's career with lasting social consequences but they just get to &quot;learn a lesson&quot; and continue on... there is so much to talk about what's wrong with C-suite culture in the US (and the impact of the law) there where the specific misdeed in question is more of a distraction from what needs to be fixed than not.<br /> <br /> Being fired over a false sexual harassment claim is obviously reputationally worse than being fired for stealing office supplies, but if office supply theft was what was up the new management team's craw and we looking to make an example of someone without even looking into things, the mechanisms of firing without due diligence would be exactly the same.<br /> <br /> Also keep in mind that your boss got fired so easily because of the same courts you want people to emulate: the default status of workers in the US is under the &quot;at-will&quot; doctrine where - outside of some exceptions - employer can fire employees whenever they want for any reason they want that doesn't fall into said exceptions. They courts decided the burden was on employees to demonstrate wrongful termination (and set the bar pretty high), not on employers to have just cause strong enough to defend in court before they fire someone. According to the US courts, if someone is fired for sexual harassment, we should believe they're a sexual harasser until they prove otherwise, because the presumption of innocence goes to the employer instead. I'm pretty sure you'd rather us not follow the courts feelings on that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-24T16:54:40-07:00","id":1523104,"title":"","content":"Here's a petty one - I managed to get a blood-blister under my toenail, and now the nail is slooooowly falling off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-25T09:43:36-07:00","id":1523140,"title":"","content":"I found out that I must have an allergy to certain cleaning chemicals yesterday as I started to have watery eyes and a running nose when I visited my Dad in extended care yesterday and I started to feel better after I left. I better take a test to find out what I'm allergic to now and better stock up on my allergy meds.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd22","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-26T17:06:25-07:00","id":1523191,"title":"","content":"Sad new for fellow NCIS fans like myself. David MCallum who played Doctor Mallard and before that The Man From U.N.C.L.E. passed away at age 90.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-26T21:04:47-07:00","id":1523196,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1523140#post1523140\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I found out that I must have an allergy to certain cleaning chemicals yesterday as I started to have watery eyes and a running nose when I visited my Dad in extended care yesterday and I started to feel better after I left. I better take a test to find out what I'm allergic to now and better stock up on my allergy meds.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's no fun, but there are definitely much worse ways to find out you have an allergy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-27T10:48:47-07:00","id":1523220,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1523196#post1523196\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's no fun, but there are definitely much worse ways to find out you have an allergy.</div> </div> </div> </div>True I could had have a severe reaction and had to be taken to the hospital.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-28T04:32:23-07:00","id":1523269,"title":"","content":"I can't safely access Discord from my phone, so I have no idea how to talk to people on work breaks. Some sort of new way to download malware just by viewing an image in the app. I also dont know how Ill even figure out when the issue is patched, except doing it through Chrome on my desktop, where its already patched.<br /> <br /> This is double sad because I wanted to vent there about an incident at work that is making me sad. A bird crashed into a doorway top and didnt even die immediately. But there was nothing I could do for it, so I just had to watch them sweep up the poor dying animal and put it in a dumpster","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-28T10:41:09-07:00","id":1523279,"title":"","content":"The webp image security issue (which wasn't specific to Discord, it impacted pretty much everything) should be fixed in the latest updates of Discord, all your browsers, and so on. The exploit was pretty easily shutdown once it was figured out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-30T08:07:31-07:00","id":1523352,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1523140#post1523140\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I found out that I must have an allergy to certain cleaning chemicals yesterday as I started to have watery eyes and a running nose when I visited my Dad in extended care yesterday and I started to feel better after I left. I better take a test to find out what I'm allergic to now and better stock up on my allergy meds.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh no!! That sucks... hopefully you can figure out what's causing the allergy..<br /> <br /> <br /> My venting: I had covid at the end of August and it suuuucks. A few weeks later my kid picked it up at work, and then a week later my wife got it too. Ugh. It's mostly just been allergy like symptoms, but it still sucks to deal with...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-30T11:07:56-07:00","id":1523359,"title":"","content":"I have suffered from seasonal allergies when I hit my early 40's. But in recent years I wasn't suffering from it and I forgot how uncomfortable it can be with watery eyes, and other systems and to bad about your family also getting sick with covid.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-04T09:51:15-07:00","id":1523559,"title":"","content":"A quick legal question for the more legal scholars on this site. On the Russel Brand situation we are getting people like Kathy Griffith and others who claim that they knew about these actions and yet didn't bother to let Law Enforcement know that it was happening and saving possible future victims.<br /> <br /> Doesn't this make them at least open to charges of being Accessories after the fact in a court of law? Either way it doesn't make them look good and hurts there image and it just allegations and no formal charges have been laid.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-04T22:12:25-07:00","id":1523600,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1523559#post1523559\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A quick legal question for the more legal scholars on this site. On the Russel Brand situation we are getting people like Kathy Griffith and others who claim that they knew about these actions and yet didn't bother to let Law Enforcement know that it was happening and saving possible future victims.<br /> <br /> Doesn't this make them at least open to charges of being Accessories after the fact in a court of law? Either way it doesn't make them look good and hurts there image and it just allegations and no formal charges have been laid.</div> </div> </div> </div>While I am not the legal side of anything outside of DUI's and speeding tickets, it needs be asked: <i>does it</i> make them look not good, hurts their image, become just allegation instead of any formal charging?<br /> <br /> Here's the thing: I've been on the sidelines of someone trying to bring forth harm done to another person that the person in question wasn't willing to it announce themselves, and it fucking sucked for everyone. The victim in question quickly got assaulted by all fronts from the offending actor's cadre of friends, families and associates, and just as quickly denied it when pressed on it. The person who brought it forward got shut down and was burdened with all kinds of accusations about why they were lying (everything from trying trying fuck either or both sides of the relationship to trying to get a quick trip of the 15 Minutes of Fame Express) which led to them having to quit their job and move(only a city away, but still), and the abuser in question moved the two of them out to another state to further isolate the victim, to the point that it's about now, after over a decade of this going on, that she's finally out on her own and taking it to court again on her own terms.<br /> <br /> That's anecdotal and therefore of limited use in a larger scope, but the larger examination of this issue is that unless the victim of a thing is willing to take the stand themselves, no amount of outside argument makes a dent and very frequently doesn't help.<br /> <br /> Also, and on a more individual level-There's a degree of fuzziness to the subject, but the primary thing of the matter, that is a big part of the reason why we have documentation about failures on the subject, is that it does fall to the fact that it is the victim's problem, and therefore it's kind of a violation of their own agency and power to act outside of it. This primarily comes up because a lot of cases on these sorts of matters tend to crash because the victim can't exercise the agency and strength needed to get through it-and the victim's agency and strength is the core of the entire affair. They can get all the love and support and outside action they want, but if the victim feels like they can't carry through to the end, the majority of the time, it stops when they do. Trying to kickstart it without them in that state where they can do it, more often than not, turns them into a dead weight.<br /> <br /> This is one of those reasons why it can be years after the fact before any action is taken-a victim often has to recover the strength in order to really stand for themselves.<br /> <br /> So, like, does it look bad? Does it hurt their image? Not really. It looks like people moving in pace with the victim, supporting with the stages they are at, and not bringing more than they can handle at any given moment.<br /> <br /> The thing about supporting victims is that it's not about being a fucking knight, charging in and taking action. It looks like <i>supporting the fucking victim</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-04T23:33:20-07:00","id":1523607,"title":"","content":"On a purely legal standpoint, no, Kathy Griffin isn't in any legal peril. The prosecution would have to demonstrate she acted in a fashion deliberately to help Russell Brand avoid consequences for committing a crime. &quot;My friend didn't want to press charges, so I didn't go to the police,&quot; is all the defense she needs, and the prosecution would have to actively demonstrate that to be a lie for there to be a crime. Russell Brand would also have to be either facing criminal charges in the US, or there be solid evidence that he would be facing charges in the US if Kathy Griffin had acted differently; you can't be an accessory to a crime that didn't happen in the eyes of the law.<br /> <br /> Also, in US law, what citizens are required to report to police rather than wait for the police to come to them varies wildly. Every state and the federal government has different standards when it comes to mandatory reporters (public figures are not those inherently anyway), and different minimums for it to be a crime not to report a crime (where the crime in question comes with mandatory jail time is a frequent cutoff). Failing to report witnessing a civil offense (most cases of sexual harassment are civil matters) instead of a criminal offense is almost never a crime (the exceptions are usually tied to something like a conspiracy charge where the civil offense are part of a larger criminal conspiracy as acts that further the conspiracy)..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-05T14:01:19-07:00","id":1523660,"title":"","content":"I was just curious as my legal knowledge begins and ends with books by John Grisham, Jon Lescourt, Steve Martini and Lisa Scotaline.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-10T16:55:05-07:00","id":1523932,"title":"","content":"As a Canadian I like to say sorry for anyone that watched Robyn Hood by Director X through VPN or other platforms. Usually we write and direct better shows then this like Rookie Blue, Flash Point, Murdoch Mysteries, Stargate SG1 or even Heartland then this badly written, acted, poor action scenes that this show has graced us with. Or general lack of research what protestors can legally do. Sorry Director X and his fellow Showrunners for Robyn Hood, but you can't protest on private property as that is 1st Degree Criminal Trepassing and John Prince is well within his legal rights to ask you to leave and call the police and depending on how the Province handles such matters it can be quite costly.<br /> <br /> In Alberta where I live First Degree Trepassing is a $10,000 fine for the 1st time, 25,000 for each new time and if the judge was really tough he or she can impose 6 months of jail time. You can also add Disturbing The Peace charges on top of that which is a $5,000 fine and perhaps 6 months of jail time<br /> <br /> I'm not going into the serious jail time that Robyn Hood and her crew for there crimes and after two espiodes haven't really shown why she and her crew are the heroes and why John Prince is the bad guy in the series. All in all I'm not impressed by the lack of skill on display here.<br /> <br /> Were usually better at making decent tv shows then this people and I like to say sorry for the bad show. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 10-18-2023, 12:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-10T17:41:37-07:00","id":1523936,"title":"","content":"You gave us Stargate, your country has some credit built up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-12T08:54:32-07:00","id":1524003,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1523037#post1523037\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This happened around 2007.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think some things have occurred in the last sixteen years to help reinforce the fact that the greatest danger and unequal power distribution in the world is not directed towards people who might be targeted with false sexual abuse allegations by malicious actors.<br /> <br /> I mean, it's no less a world now than it was then when any allegation of such abuse at all will bring out large numbers of people who care a lot about innocence until being proved guilty (for a person who is not actually even imprisoned yet) for that crime in particular.<br /> <br /> They never seem to quite have the same concern for the reputations of people accused of, like, financial crimes.<br /> <br /> (Also, not bringing private information to police is bad because it curtails protection for potential future victims, but keeping allegations of such crimes out of the eyes of such hypothetical victims such that they'd be able to avoid association is okay?)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":158,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","user":"Isator Levi","date":". 10-12-2023, 11:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-13T21:52:04-07:00","id":1524057,"title":"","content":"On month eight of &quot;Human Resources fucked up my paperwork&quot;, month three of &quot;and that's making it nearly impossible to find a job&quot;, and week four of &quot;my newest job offer is in limbo while my would-be employer is actively telling HR to get their shit together&quot;. I just want to be a logistician, and HRs own damn records show they discharged me erroneously. FFS, I'm glad I have savings and accommodating family.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon",