he can force even more smaller companies to tie themselves into Amazon's ecosystem by making it the only affordable user-verification platform around.</div> </div> </div> </div>The whole thing is so insane to me! I'm with you, I don't think they thought at all about the ramifications of this. This is going to kill so much stuff it just boggles my mind... ugh.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-08-05T11:23:57-07:00","id":1552922,"title":"","content":"I'm dismayed that certain YouTubers like Ranting For Vengeance hasn't had his channel banned when he goes on racist tirades against people who don't have the same skin color as him.<br /> <br /> I saw him go after a man named Midnight who had the audacity to like Absolute Batman. I know that Ranting For Vengeance is 15 or so years old. But to have to say that much hate is disturbing for someone so young<br /> <br /> Anyway Midnight addressed Ranting For Vengeance about why he likes Absolute Batman in a intelligent and calm manner and in response the teen called him a illiterate trogdulte and used Midnight dark skin color as a weapon.<br /> <br /> I'm thinking calm down kid, it's a comic book and people have different tastes and I knew that as a teenager, I didn't insult people for liking Wolverine of the X-Men even though I didn't care for the character.<br /> <br /> On a side note it sounds like that the Absolute line is like DC old Elseworlds tales that was done when I was younger and I was curious what kind of takes they had on classic characters and trying to keep true to the core concepts of said characters.<br /> <br /> More proof that watching Space Ice, Media Zealot and Warhammer 40 K lore channels is a good choice and cat \ud83d\udc31\ud83d\udc08 videos.<br /> <br /> Another side note, I think that Ranting For Vengeance isn't acting at all. I truly believe that he is a hateful person who dislikes people who are different from his narrow worldview.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 08-05-2025, 02:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-08-05T13:40:24-07:00","id":1552930,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1552918#post1552918\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The whole thing is so insane to me! I'm with you, I don't think they thought at all about the ramifications of this. This is going to kill so much stuff it just boggles my mind... ugh.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, for now, there is a small hope that with the OSA just being the UK (so most websites are just going to geolock UK IPs from viewing their content if they can't afford age verification), that the UK's buyers remorse over this law will get all the other places that seem to be considering copying it to reconsider.<br /> <br /> It probably isn't helping people trying to push OSA style laws elsewhere to see the massive public backlash over Collective Shout bullying payment processors into censoring Steam and itch.io.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure how it wasn't clear a decade ago, but if governments are finally going to start actually caring about making the Internet &quot;safe&quot; it should be painfully obvious that just passing nanny state, &quot;Won't someone think of the children!&quot; nonsense isn't actually going to be enough. The Internet isn't safe because people in power let a bunch of rich assholes be in charge of it, and rich assholes make more money when they don't have to pay for the things that make stuff safe.<br /> <br /> I also have a very simple heuristic when looking at proposed regulations that has never steered me wrong: if you're going to require people (and real people, not fictional persons aka corps) to use a service to comply with a regulation, the state has to be ready to provide that service. If you want age verification services on the Internet? The government needs to have their own (and frankly every major developed country does have age verification systems already, they just don't have a good system to rapidly communicate that to websites and apps) way of providing that service. <br /> <br /> In the US car insurance is scammy has hell, because you have to have car insurance to legally drive anywhere, and the US is built around making people drive to get what they need. There is no public car insurance option, so you're at the mercy of whatever company you can afford. That's obviously bad.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile you also need a license to drive... which you get from the government. And it might not be a perfect system but getting and maintaining a driver's license is very straight forward and you don't have scumbags trying to sell you cheap licenses that are for real legit because... only the government issues legit ones.<br /> <br /> It really shouldn't be hard to get a &quot;digital license&quot; where you take some existing government ID to a government office, and they can give you a ID card that doesn't contain all your sensitive data, but counts as proof of age for websites. So many potential problems vanish quickly.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1552922#post1552922\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm dismayed that certain YouTubers like Ranting For Vengeance hasn't had his channel banned when he goes on racist tirades against people who don't have the same skin color as him.</div> </div> </div> </div>Alphabet, aka Google, aka YouTube, is an American company, and American has recently decided that the only discrimination that actually counts is if it's against White Christians... and I really wish I was being hyperbolic or joking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-08-05T20:13:48-07:00","id":1552941,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1552922#post1552922\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm dismayed that certain YouTubers like Ranting For Vengeance hasn't had his channel banned when he goes on racist tirades against people who don't have the same skin color as him.</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't watch, don't comment, don't dislike. Simply don't engage with in any capacity.<br /> <br /> You should certainly flag him to the platform every time you can, but that's about it. Your only real means to do something about those jerks is to deny them your attention (and the benefits it brings them, because every attention besides reporting is good for the content creator).<br /> <br /> I'm currently pissed because Trump is about to extend the Magnitsky penalties to people only tangentially related to the Brazilian Supreme Court, like spouses of the judges and minor assistants.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"l