ame is 100% comprised of AI generated slop!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude1e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-07T22:00:47-07:00","id":1559831,"title":"","content":"That sucks DarkKing that something you enjoyed didn't turn out good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-11T04:25:54-07:00","id":1559878,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DarkKing</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1559816#post1559816\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You know you're getting old, when you forget your own age. I kept thinking I was a year younger than I actually am.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ha!! I know exactly how that goes. I've done that myself. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-11T11:58:46-07:00","id":1559887,"title":"","content":"I still think I'm twenty despite the graying hair and laugh lines.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-13T09:14:01-07:00","id":1559923,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1559824#post1559824\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's amazing how Anita Sarkasian is living rent free in the heads of gaming grifters. It was discovered that she was listed as a consultant for a good game that they were enjoying and did a complete 180 on it. Funny thing is that she has been pretty low profile on social media for a few years and been doing what she likes.<br /> <br /> Also they seem to think that Consultants can dictate terms to huge corporations and what they can or cannot do.<br /> <br /> They just give feedback and advice and that is it. Big business are no obligation to follow it and entertainment companies have always had consultants to work on making projects better or more plausible.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is she? Im pretty into gamer culture and i havnt heard much of her in years outside of a femminist/marxist critique on in 2021 were she was a footnote in a larger discussion about rainbow/intersectional capitalism of the 10's","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-13T12:15:15-07:00","id":1559928,"title":"","content":"It's not a mainstream thing, as Lysander put it's a relatively small group of online hate grifters trying to rile people up for influence/clout and grift. The problem is that it has, to some extent, worked.<br /> <br /> Slay the Spire 2 was already suffering from a more justified review bomb fueled by their Chinese audience because the Chinese government blocked any other easily accessed way to give feedback on the game (StS2 is in Steam's Early Access program, so it's basically in an open beta phase, but Chinese players can't use Steam Access's internal reporting functions, can't use the reporting function Mega Crit but into the Early Access version of the game, and China blocks Discord so things can't be reported there either).<br /> <br /> Just as Mega Crit was starting to address the feedback with updates (again, this is supposed to be happening for a beta testing game) and at least stop the negative review flood that was tanking their rankings in Steam's storefront, this little bit of nothing is keeping Mega Crit from recovering faster to reclaim their overall positive review status (justifiably, while the negative Chinese reviews are slowly, most of those reviews haven't been taken down or reversed because the patches and updates to address the issues are still ongoing, so any non-sense review bombing is kicking them while they're down).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-13T21:28:34-07:00","id":1559942,"title":"","content":"Is there an OS that doesn't utterly fuck up pen tablet and display settings on updates? Not asking for a friend. It's me. I'm really angry.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-14T10:43:31-07:00","id":1559961,"title":"","content":"My father does not seem to understand the social contract that if you see an opportunity to pet a golden retriever, you take it!<br /> <br /> They are the physical manifestation of unconditional love and childhood happiness. They deserve as much affection as we can give!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude21","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-14T13:57:24-07:00","id":1559965,"title":"","content":"Um no. Fuck no.<br /> <br /> Thousands of Goldens and Labs are put down every year in the US because they bite someone (esp. children) who just comes up into the personal space and starts interacting them with zero respect for social cues and so on.<br /> <br /> If you love Golden Retrievers break the cycle of violence caused by false narratives around which dog breeds are lovey-dovery snuggly cinnamon rolls and which ones are scary and whatever. Dogs are dogs. Breed matters, but socialization and individual personality matters more. If you don't know a dog? You approach the dog's human(s) so they can make sure you interact properly with their dog's needs.<br /> <br /> Humans decide it's fine and dandy to kill dogs for problems humans cause that stress dogs out to the point of needing to bite to express their discomfort. Don't get dogs killed by promoting nonsense about how it's fine to just go up and &quot;love&quot; on a certain dog breeds. It's not love, because again, it's a great way to get innocent dogs killed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-14T15:15:31-07:00","id":1559969,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1559965#post1559965\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Um no. Fuck no.<br /> <br /> Thousands of Goldens and Labs are put down every year in the US because they bite someone (esp. children) who just comes up into the personal space and starts interacting them with zero respect for social cues and so on.<br /> <br /> If you love Golden Retrievers break the cycle of violence caused by false narratives around which dog breeds are lovey-dovery snuggly cinnamon rolls and which ones are scary and whatever. Dogs are dogs. Breed matters, but socialization and individual personality matters more. If you don't know a dog? You approach the dog's human(s) so they can make sure you interact properly with their dog's needs.<br /> <br /> Humans decide it's fine and dandy to kill dogs for problems humans cause that stress dogs out to the point of needing to bite to express their discomfort. Don't get dogs killed by promoting nonsense about how it's fine to just go up and &quot;love&quot; on a certain dog breeds. It's not love, because again, it's a great way to get innocent dogs killed.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know what sort of evil spirit has attached itself to the aura of those people, but I have never in my life seen a golden retriever who was not immediately friendly with anything it saw.<br /> <br /> I've even seen literal guard dogs that just wanted some head pats, before they'd stand down and welcome you in for some tea and crumpets.<br /> <br /> Hell, they even have meme videos about how much golden retrievers are just perpetually happy to be included.<br /> <br /> So if a human did something to get bitten by one, they were probably a PoS who deserved it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-14T15:31:24-07:00","id":1559971,"title":"","content":"Although that does bring something else to my attention that I'm confused about<b></b>: Why is it that society's response to a dog attack is &quot;the dog has to die. There are no other options.&quot;<br /> <br /> Because if you're training them to be a guard dog, or a K-9 unit, I'm pretty sure they are specifically trained to attack people. It's part of their job description!<br /> <br /> So why is it okay for them to do so, but household pets get the axe?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-14T19:36:46-07:00","id":1559975,"title":"","content":"Working dogs are not supposed to be showered with affection when &quot;on the clock&quot;. This results in things like missed cues, which can mean that either some substance doesn't get caught or an important cue that a service animal was supposed to pick up on (like the prelude to a seizure) gets through the cracks. Seeing-eye dogs are perhaps the most direct demonstration of this principle, because they're trained to be a blind human's eyes, which is a full time job.<br /> <br /> And, of course, all animals have some sense of personal space and territory. Even dogs, frozen in wolf neoteny as they are, aren't quite permanent puppies in truth, and if they have an established sense of territory, the number one rule is Beware of Dog.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DarkKing</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1559971#post1559971\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Although that does bring something else to my attention that I'm confused about<b></b>: Why is it that society's response to a dog attack is &quot;the dog has to die. There are no other options.&quot;<br /> <br /> Because if you're training them to be a guard dog, or a K-9 unit, I'm pretty sure they are specifically trained to attack people. It's part of their job description!<br /> <br /> So why is it okay for them to do so, but household pets get the axe?</div> </div> </div> </div>No, K-9 units (both civilian and military) tend to use dogs for their sharp senses and capability to find something of import via training. Humans tend to frown on training attack dogs because the dogs in question end up kind of in the same boat that military personnel do, with a lot of PTSD and the capacity to turn off whatever typical behavioral restrictions keep them from performing violence. Keep in mind that social animals have a weird relationship with violence, and a lot of them were sculpted by selection pressures to have a lot of ways to avoid using it among their own.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-14T19:44:20-07:00","id":1559976,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1559975#post1559975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Working dogs are not supposed to be showered with affection when &quot;on the clock&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, yes, that's obviously an exception. They even wear signs asking you not to do so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-14T21:33:18-07:00","id":1559980,"title":"","content":"The fact that we have to put signs on working dogs so people don't go up and screw with them is the problem. People's presumption that all dogs are their friends and they have the right to all dog's physical space is the biggest cause of dog behavioral problems, and that leads to most dog bites, and thus most dogs that get put down for no other reason than humans giving them impossible rules to follow.<br /> <br /> Consider what it's like to work with rescue animals. If you never have, maybe you should. All of that &quot;dogs love me&quot; energy you have? That gets you bit by dogs in the middle of massive traumatic problems. You can have the most positive energy ever. You're not a piece of shit. You're not haunted by an evil spirit. You're trying to help a dog that's been betrayed by the people that were supposed to treat it's love with healthy love in response. It needs patience. It needs calm. It needs low energy situations were trust can be rebuilt because you don't assume anything about your right to be near them and wait for them to let you in so they learn you will listen where others didn't.<br /> <br /> I have had dogs in my personal life get court ordered death sentences because the simple rule of ask the humans with the dog first wasn't followed. I've worked shelters with owners killing themselves with stress because they will not put animals down, but finding potential owners that are willing to overcome our stupid stereotypes about breeds and actually engage with the dogs as individuals is so damned hard.<br /> <br /> I'm going to say this again, because this is really serious to me:<br /> <br /> If you go around saying any dog is there for you to force your desire for physical contact on - not matter how much flowery language about love and good tempers you put around it - you are actively putting dogs in danger. Dogs, innocent loving dogs breed to imprint on us, are killed by us all the time because these stereotypes are bad; even if you say them as positively as possible.<br /> <br /> You want to know why we kill dogs for our own mistakes? The same reason you feel comfortable walking up to a dog you don't know and putting your hands all over them. In both cases, if you did that to a human, you'd be evil. If you do it to a dog, you're asserting that humans are the masters to the dogs. Humans are social creatures. We put human rights over other animals' rights. We didn't spend thousands of years breeding dogs to be our equals. So when humans do things that push dogs into misbehaving, the dogs suffer for being less than us; and the only thing we can do to protect dogs is to make preach to as many as possible the need to be responsible for the animals we've bred to be the way they are. Because we're going to - as a species - always view dogs as lesser. But we can choose to mean that we own them responsible treatment as the ones in charge over choosing to mean that we get to do whatever we want to them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-14T23:21:45-07:00","id":1559982,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1559980#post1559980\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You want to know why we kill dogs for our own mistakes? The same reason you feel comfortable walking up to a dog you don't know and putting your hands all over them. In both cases, if you did that to a human, you'd be evil. If you do it to a dog, you're asserting that humans are the masters to the dogs. Humans are social creatures. We put human rights over other animals' rights. We didn't spend thousands of years breeding dogs to be our equals. So when humans do things that push dogs into misbehaving, the dogs suffer for being less than us; and the only thing we can do to protect dogs is to make preach to as many as possible the need to be responsible for the animals we've bred to be the way they are. Because we're going to - as a species - always view dogs as lesser. But we can choose to mean that we own them responsible treatment as the ones in charge over choosing to mean that we get to do whatever we want to them.</div> </div> </div> </div>In my defense, it was laying down in the back of a pickup truck at the post office, and I let it sniff my hand before proceeding further.<br /> <br /> I didn't just run up and start stroking it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-15T09:41:02-07:00","id":1559988,"title":"","content":"[QUOTE=Heavy Arms;n1559928]It's not a mainstream thing, as Lysander put it's a relatively small group of online hate grifters trying to rile people up for influence/clout and grift. The problem is that it has, to some extent, worked.<br /> <br /> Indeed that is true as it was pointed out was that Anita hadn't had much of presence on Social Media until Slay The Spire 2 listed her as one of their consultants and suddenly the grifters who are not getting the views as they used to get latched onto it and made a big deal out of it. It didn't work out the way they thought it did as she largely forgotten about and young gamers had to google her to find what the &quot;scandal&quot; was about.<br /> <br /> While I didn't agree with all her takes and thought she reaching in some of her reports, she did have a true statement of how women were depicted in the medium at the time as eye candy or prizes to be won and the harrasement was way out proporation and actually proved her point about there was and is still sexism in the industry and entertainment companies are starting to course correct and making it more incluisve.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-16T02:06:58-07:00","id":1560017,"title":"","content":"I am growing increasingly angry with how frequently youtube ads keep playing an Amazon Meet Health commercial that immediately depicts a woman breast feeding on camera, with audible suckling sounds.<br /> <br /> Also, who the fuck decided to include the lines <i>&quot;hey, you little milk guzzler&quot;</i> and <i>&quot;right now, mom's boob is hurting about as much as your trip down the birth canal?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Fire them! Fire them, and then toss them out the executive floor window!<br /> <br /> And, of course, it would have to be AI Slop generated too...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-16T05:16:51-07:00","id":1560023,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DarkKing</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1560017#post1560017\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am growing increasingly angry with how frequently youtube ads keep playing an Amazon Meet Health commercial that immediately depicts a woman breast feeding on camera, with audible suckling sounds.<br /> <br /> Also, who the fuck decided to include the lines <i>&quot;hey, you little milk guzzler&quot;</i> and <i>&quot;right now, mom's boob is hurting about as much as your trip down the birth canal?&quot;</i><br /> <br /> Fire them! Fire them, and then toss them out the executive floor window!<br /> <br /> And, of course, it would have to be A