0031\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ublock doesn't work on Chrome anymore, because it's no longer supported. But I hear it's still good on Firefox.</div> </div> </div> </div>Aww...sorry it doesn't work for Chrome. That sucks...<br /> <br /> Glad about Firefox though, I'll have to check it out. I'm using Adblock, but nothing says I can't use both. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":24,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","user":"Mr Gone","date":". 05-20-2026, 07:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-17T19:02:15-07:00","id":1560051,"title":"","content":"Ordered some Domino's tonight because I was feeling kind of lazy and wanted some pizza. The deliver driver showed up on a motorcycle carrying the pizza box sideways like he'd never seen a pizza before in his life. Of course the toppings had all slid off and made a huge mess. So I called the Domino's store to complain and they told me the driver was with Doordash so there was nothing they could do, I'd need to contact Doordash to get a refund. The lady on the phone even said that when the driver grabbed the box he held it sidewise and she yelled, &quot;Wait, don't do that!&quot; but he ignored her and drove off. So she knew I was telling the truth, but she couldn't do anything about it on her end.<br /> <br /> I don't even have Doordash so I had to find their number and they told me they can only do refunds if I ordered through the app, and since Domino's had effectively hired this guy, it was on them to refund me. So then I had to call Domino's corporate helpline and they tried sending me back to Doordash and I had to argue for almost 30 minutes but I finally got a refund. <br /> <br /> What a pain in the ass.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude1e","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-18T07:02:52-07:00","id":1560061,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>anubisxy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1560051#post1560051\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">ordered some domino's tonight because i was feeling kind of lazy and wanted some pizza. The deliver driver showed up on a motorcycle carrying the pizza box sideways like he'd never seen a pizza before in his life. Of course the toppings had all slid off and made a huge mess. So i called the domino's store to complain and they told me the driver was with doordash so there was nothing they could do, i'd need to contact doordash to get a refund. The lady on the phone even said that when the driver grabbed the box he held it sidewise and she yelled, &quot;wait, don't do that!&quot; but he ignored her and drove off. So she knew i was telling the truth, but she couldn't do anything about it on her end.<br /> <br /> I don't even have doordash so i had to find their number and they told me they can only do refunds if i ordered through the app, and since domino's had effectively hired this guy, it was on them to refund me. So then i had to call domino's corporate helpline and they tried sending me back to doordash and i had to argue for almost 30 minutes but i finally got a refund.<br /> <br /> What a pain in the ass.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>Hands would be thrown!!</b><br /> <br /> I would lay waste to the city, for this grievous insult. Not just to you as a customer, but to the collective intelligence of humanity itself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":29009,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","user":"DarkKing","date":". 05-18-2026, 10:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-19T18:33:13-07:00","id":1560104,"title":"","content":"Gripe Update: Apparently it might not be Windows Update. It might just be Huion making materials intended to crap out in 2-3 years. Still, fingers crossed for USB-A cable bypassing the one in the 3-in-1 cable.<br /> <br /> Edit: Nope, the drawing function is bricked.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","user":"Saur Ops Specialist","date":". 05-20-2026, 12:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude1e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-20T04:30:46-07:00","id":1560119,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1560051#post1560051\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ordered some Domino's tonight because I was feeling kind of lazy and wanted some pizza. The deliver driver showed up on a motorcycle carrying the pizza box sideways like he'd never seen a pizza before in his life. Of course the toppings had all slid off and made a huge mess. So I called the Domino's store to complain and they told me the driver was with Doordash so there was nothing they could do, I'd need to contact Doordash to get a refund. The lady on the phone even said that when the driver grabbed the box he held it sidewise and she yelled, &quot;Wait, don't do that!&quot; but he ignored her and drove off. So she knew I was telling the truth, but she couldn't do anything about it on her end.<br /> <br /> I don't even have Doordash so I had to find their number and they told me they can only do refunds if I ordered through the app, and since Domino's had effectively hired this guy, it was on them to refund me. So then I had to call Domino's corporate helpline and they tried sending me back to Doordash and I had to argue for almost 30 minutes but I finally got a refund.<br /> <br /> What a pain in the ass.</div> </div> </div> </div>What the hell is wrong with people!? There's no way they didn't know not to hold a pizza box like that... I get that doordash drivers are under a lot of pressure to get stuff to people fast, but if you can't deliver it properly then don't do it. Ugh..<br /> <br /> Sorry you had to deal with that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-05-21T22:19:39-07:00","id":1560146,"title":"","content":"Office politics are such a relentless bore especially in educations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core