ng> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1562545#post1562545\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I only became aware of him over his cringe rant over Transformers 1 and how he crashed out because the voice actors for Megatron and Bumblebee were black and I checked his other videos and they were filled with him being racist, homophobic, transphobic, sexist and antisemitic rants.</div> </div> </div> </div>Bumblebee had a voice actor?<br /> <br /> I thought his voice box was damaged?<br /> <br /> But yeah, he sounds like an imbecile. Getting mad at actors who don't even make a physical appearance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29009-darkking","name":"DarkKing","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29009_1.png","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-03T08:05:46-07:00","id":1562556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1562544#post1562544\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why are you insisting there's some increase of crime in the UK? Do you have any specific dataset to point to on this? Everything you're bringing up has completely different reasons than what you're asserting.</div> </div> </div> </div>