tations to the taste buds that increase perception for some key compounds.<br /> <br /> With that I finally understood why alcohol taste like bleach and coffee like concentrated ash.<br /> <br /> Coffee isn't, in the end, a matter of finding the right brew for me. They all suck and that's that.<br /> <br /> Because having prosopagnosia wasn't enough.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude1e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-30T11:17:18-07:00","id":1563637,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1563601#post1563601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mr. Gone Tobias Forge recent statement made me remember a documentary called The Other F Word that focused on Punk Rock bands like Pennywise with it front person Jim Lindberg who at the time was in his early 40's and had three school age daughters and more or less stated that touring is a young person game and it focused on other musicians who were around the same age and were parents themselves and we were not big on touring anymore for various reasons</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea, it's gotta be rough touring, especially if you have a family. The shows they're doing are awesome, but I totally understand needing a break...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-30T17:53:09-07:00","id":1563654,"title":"","content":"Also in the documentary they also talked about how the music industry was changing dramatically and many companies in the music industry went under and one of the singers mentioned that making money off of record sales wasn't no longer enough. Heavy Arms could give a way better picture of what was happening at the time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-30T18:01:08-07:00","id":1563657,"title":"","content":"I no longer want to gatekeep people out of popular franchises, but if you're a racist, homophobic, transphobic, sexist and antisemitic jerk then you shouldn't be allowed in as bring nothing positive to the table.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-30T20:58:15-07:00","id":1563667,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1563657#post1563657\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I no longer want to gatekeep people out of popular franchises, but if you're a racist, homophobic, transphobic, sexist and antisemitic jerk then you shouldn't be allowed in as bring nothing positive to the table.</div> </div> </div> </div>They shouldn't be disallowed from being part of a fandom. They should be disallowed from saying this kind of thing.<br /> <br /> Spreading hate and using words as a tool of violence isn't a right. It isn't expression of ideas but using words as weapons to hurt people. It has not to be tolerated anywhere, not even by the law.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-30T21:47:48-07:00","id":1563670,"title":"","content":"I remember back when I was a regular poster on Alavro message boards that dealt with comics and the mods did a admirable job of stopping rage baiting and trolling before it got out of hand. Now judging by because of the size of YouTube and other platforms it seems harder to stop such horrible abuse of terms of services and perhaps they don't have enough mods to do the job or their using ai and it doesn't catch everything.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-31T06:21:30-07:00","id":1563684,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1563670#post1563670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now judging by because of the size of YouTube and other platforms it seems harder to stop such horrible abuse of terms of services and perhaps they don't have enough mods to do the job or their using ai and it doesn't catch everything.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, they just don't try.<br /> <br /> Unfortunately this has been made clear several times already. Social media platforms make a lot of money out of outrageous content, so the effort they put is minimal.<br /> <br /> While they still claim difficulty dealing with abuse and stuff, it's actually easier than ever to moderate platforms today, and those for profit platforms are perfectly able to hire more mods of they want, as they actually do for infractions they care about.<br /> <br /> The reason they don't stop abuse is only that it is profitable, so they do only the bare minimum effort required by law.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude1e","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-31T08:12:27-07:00","id":1563691,"title":"","content":"That makes it worse Montparnasse is that they will look the other way until outcry becomes to much to ignore. It certainly explains why channels like Critical Drinker, Nerdrotic, Ranting For Vengeance, Ryan Kinel can get away with everything.<br /> <br /> But a smaller channels like Commdin Cam gets hit when he did a brief tribute to the late Peter Cullen and he used footage of the late actor iconic work and they said he violated copyright laws. He is appealing that judgment and I hope that he successfully overturns it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 08-31-2026, 12:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-31T08:32:21-07:00","id":1563694,"title":"","content":"Basically that.<br /> <br /> Unfortunately what we need is a better legal framework to deal with platform responsibility, but there's very little will to work in such laws.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\u2615","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-31T11:00:24-07:00","id":1563703,"title":"","content":"What makes the Commdin Cam situation surprising is that he has done character design rankings and used footage from the animated and live action series and the various comics that were published and YouTube had no issue then.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-31T14:48:40-07:00","id":1563708,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1563703#post1563703\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What makes the Commdin Cam situation surprising is that he has done character design rankings and used footage from the animated and live action series and the various comics that were published and YouTube had no issue then.</div> </div> </div> </div>YouTube's response depend a lot on who's making a complaint. Usually they only bother if the owner or the IP does it, especially against profitable channels. The weight of such owner also matters.<br /> <br /> There's a number of IPs that are ok to use there because the owners don't really care. Others are so litigious they pay extra to YouTube for an active vigilance service.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-31T17:37:52-07:00","id":1563726,"title":"","content":"I wonder if people know what the difference between a translation of a story and an adaptation of a story? I'm starting to think that some don't know the difference when I hear talking points at work when I hear coworkers mention a popular YouTube personality grift.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-31T17:53:10-07:00","id":1563730,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1563726#post1563726\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder if people know what the difference between a translation of a story and an adaptation of a story? I'm starting to think that some don't know the difference when I hear talking points at work when I hear coworkers mention a popular YouTube personality grift.</div> </div> </div> </div>They don't. Never did.<br /> <br /> I can unfortunately say from experience that this was a regular confusion in the 90s just as much, and seems to have been the case earlier.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-01T10:11:01-07:00","id":1563773,"title":"","content":"In regards to the Commdin Cam situation, it is Paramount that lodged the initial strike and right now he suffered a setback as YouTube said the complaint is valid. That attitude is going to make it harder for future fans of the Transformers to make videos on what they love without fear that Paramount Pictures will come down like a hammer \ud83d\udd28 \u2692\ufe0f on them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-02T12:04:32-07:00","id":1563788,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1563654#post1563654\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also in the documentary they also talked about how the music industry was changing dramatically and many companies in the music industry went under and one of the singers mentioned that making money off of record sales wasn't no longer enough. Heavy Arms could give a way better picture of what was happening at the time.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea, the music industry seems like it's a rough place at the moment. Everything is expensive, including concert tickets. So I imagine it's hard to make money as musician these days...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-02T12:44:46-07:00","id":1563790,"title":"","content":"It's always been hard to be successful in the entertainment industry. I remember what actor Doug Bradley said to Elliot from Little Punk People that if you're going in expecting fame and fortune right away then you better take a step back and rethink your career goals. <br /> <br /> The Other F Word came out in 2011 and the message is the same that success is not gaurteened. Jim Lindberg and his family lived in a nice house in a nice neighborhood but it wasn't a mansion and many of the musicians they talked to were good at there craft but we're not super rich like others.<br /> <br /> In fact the term working class band was a good description.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-02T15:37:58-07:00","id":1563791,"title":"","content":"It's easy to forget that the very famous are actually a tiny minority of musicians, and that's not even because of talent. Getting a good PR machine behind you is 90%+ of it, and depends much more in the interests of this machine than the quality of your work.<br /> <br /> Among famous musicians, actually being the one receiving the profit is also far from a given. In many cases the companies behind them got so much legal control of their music that even an ultra famous singer may be financially at a very bad position as a third class employee, if one that publicly seems to be well off.<br /> <br /> The biggest problem with the industry now isn't that its changes directly harm musicians. It's actually that those changes harm brands and companies, but don't weaken their grip on the IPs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-02T21:44:02-07:00","id":1563798,"title":"","content":"That's true about how having a great public relations team behind you is a major advantage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-03T16:18:57-07:00","id":1563814,"title":"","content":"Tragic news about Gloria Steinheim who helped spear head the modern feminist movement has passed away today.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude1e","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-06T06:45:34-07:00","id":1563867,"title":"","content":"Wow, I am certain that these AI generated ads are just being thrown onto the internet, without any human oversight now!<br /> <br /> While scrolling through youtube shorts, one ad that keeps popping up, is a Lego animation telling me that the world is being controlled by Jewish vampires!<br /> <br /> Does anybody have a copy of the Berenstain Bears laying around?<br /> <br /> Can you please check to make sure we haven't crossed into another parallel dimension without noticing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude21","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29027-greathornedratkin","name":"GreatHornedRatkin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29027_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2026"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"413"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-06T08:44:48-07:00","id":1563871,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GreatHornedRatkin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1563867#post1563867\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wow, I am certain that these AI generated ads are just being thrown onto the internet, without any human oversight now!<br /> <br /> While scrolling through youtube shorts, one ad that keeps popping up, is a Lego animation telling me that the world is being controlled by Jewish vampires!</div> </div> </div> </div>Unfortunately this is not an AI pattern. I've seen this kind of ad appear several times, usually as a very deliberate decision by certain groups as they feel the legal landscape changed enough that they won't face consequences.<br /> <br /> This is not random. There is for real people that spread this kind of story whenever they get a chance. And they can get surprisingly effective at promoting their ludicrous ideas.<br /> <br /> Jews and Roma, for example, frequently face a rise in persecution and violence after some BS story like that spreads despite being obviously BS. Literally this bizarre piece of stupidity has actual power at harming peoples lives, safety, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude1e","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-06T10:14:25-07:00","id":1563873,"title":"","content":"Since YouTube won't target channels that have blatant bigotry, homophobia, transphobia msyigony and anti-Semitism despite violations of terms of services. Is it any wonder that such folks are feeling more comfortable in expressing such views.<br /> <br /> More proof of Mike Tyson most profound quote of How social media has made people comfortable to say things that would get you beat up in real life.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-06T18:16:36-07:00","id":1563874,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1563871#post1563871\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Jews and Roma, for example, frequently face a rise in persecution and violence after some BS story like that spreads despite being obviously BS. Literally this bizarre piece of stupidity has actual power at harming peoples lives, safety, etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>In my experience, racist caricatures are so absurd, that they loop back around to being ironically hilarious.<br /> <br /> Take those old drawings about Irish people, for instance. Where they were depicted as having horns, tails and hooves.<br /> <br /> Anybody who's ever laid eyes on an Irish person should immediately recognize that was complete BS.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude21","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29027-greathornedratkin","name":"GreatHornedRatkin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29027_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2026"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"413"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-06T20:12:25-07:00","id":1563879,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GreatHornedRatkin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1563874#post1563874\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In my experience, racist caricatures are so absurd, that they loop back around to being ironically hilarious.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unfortunately the problem isn't if the caricature is believable, but if it will touch the right strings of prejudice people already have. That's why I said their effectiveness is surprising.<br /> <br /> You'd be surprised at how many bullshit people already believe about those minorities. Those who don't outright believe frequently think the accusations are too common to not have some kernel of truth. That's the problem: the ad isn't just conveying a fully fleshed idea, it is playing with the internal context of people that was already conditioned to receive it in a certain way.<br /> <br /> Sure, the caricature is obviously ridiculous. But those people keep to themselves how it is still making them think about the prejudices they learned before and ask themselves if it may be there for a reason, if the caricature either has a more solid point than it seems or at least point to something real, when they don't just believe it may actually be true, because it does fit what they think they know.<br /> <br /> The result is frequently that people will tell you that the ad, piece, whatever is too ridiculous to be taken seriously, but those same people will be looking harder for reasons to deny jobs, will be more receptive of accusations and less of the principle of innocence, will be jocking more frequently and with more cynical implications about how sometimes it does look like a conspiracy.<br /> <br /> And while most people externalize the opinion that it is ridiculous, you'll see an actual move in the statistics as persecution and violence does intensify.<br /> <br /> It is also the problem of overestimating the relevance of dominant public discourse over the personal actions of both silent majorities and a few people in position to do harm. When 5% of people believe some bullshit enough to do something about it, that means they look like an irrelevant exception from the outside, but the affected group will always be facing it regularly. Because you don't need everyone in the street or at your workplace thinking some BS of you, you only need one and for the others to think it is too little to be worth intervention as they don't know just how much things build up.<br /> <br /> Minorities get upset at apparently minor or ludicrous prejudice because we have the daily experience of this shit building up constantly, fast, and with extreme efficacy. And the things that look too absurd to be taken seriously are frequently the worse, because they are indeed not taken seriously as a problem, but they are taken seriously by those hearing dog whistles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude1e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-07T22:16:38-07:00","id":1563907,"title":"","content":"I remember a few years back when Critical Race Theory became the boogeyman and people were claiming that it was targeting children and I thought it sounded like something that would be taught in post secondary education and training for being a lawyer and wouldn't be taught to elementary and high school students at all <br /> <br /> This was before I even looked it up and proven correct and now we have the replacement theory to deal with that white nationalist groups like to throw around to insite violence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-08T03:25:22-07:00","id":1563910,"title":"","content":"I hate that producers of some goods like salt and sugar are allowed to use technical truths to say blatant lies to consumers with no legal repercussions.<br /> <br /> There is no such a thing as healthier salt or healthier sugar. Period. The end. Just not.<br /> <br /> Brown sugar, muscovado, kokuto, rapadura/panela, they are not healthier to use as sugar, just as Himalayan salt, yukishio and others are not healthier to use as salt.<br /> <br /> Sugar and salt are highly concentrated and will be bad for you in large quantities, while mineral content is comparatively negligible. So even if you get a variety Y with 20 times more minerals than variety X, for this to make a difference you would have to eat way more than you should.<br /> <br /> People in Okinawa are not healthier because the sugar or salt have more minerals, even if they technically do. Chose what tastes better for you, other than that salt is salt and sugar is sugar.<br /> <br /> Also, using sugar cane doesn't make soda less bad for your health. The acidic liquid converts sucrose into fructose to begin with, so most of the difference doesn't survive to the shelf. And even if it did, drinking 32 grams of sugar in a can is the problem, the proportion of fructose to glucose is inconsequential at this point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-08T06:54:22-07:00","id":1563913,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GreatHornedRatkin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1563874#post1563874\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Take those old drawings about Irish people, for instance. Where they were depicted as having horns, tails and hooves.<br /> <br /> Anybody who's ever laid eyes on an Irish person should immediately recognize that was complete BS.</div> </div> </div> </div>Person, do you know what a metaphor is?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-08T07:51:44-07:00","id":1563914,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1563913#post1563913\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Person, do you know what a metaphor is?</div> </div> </div> </div>I do, but that doesn't make it any less ridiculous.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude21","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29027-greathornedratkin","name":"GreatHornedRatkin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29027_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2026"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"413"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-08T08:34:36-07:00","id":1563915,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GreatHornedRatkin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1563914#post1563914\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I do, but that doesn't make it any less ridiculous.</div> </div> </div> </div>Being ridiculous is irrelevant when it was something that was communicating between people who hated Irish people what they thought of them, and how that led to actual substantive things like substandard housing, poor employment, denial of services and business, and overpolicing.<br /> <br /> People in a position of that kind of power have a luxury to be absurd with how they characterise the subjects of their persecution, and they flaunt it. A perspective of &quot;oh, bigots sure are silly&quot; is really missing the point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-08T08:59:13-07:00","id":1563916,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GreatHornedRatkin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1563914#post1563914\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I do, but that doesn't make it any less ridiculous.</div> </div> </div> </div>It helps reinforce terrible stereotypes of what people of other ethnic groups are thought of.<br /> <br /> Irish people as you mentioned were seen as subhuman thugs who were denied employment during the 19th century and even barely a century their was still strong hatred for them.<br /> <br /> The late boxer Joe Lewis grand daughter was shown artwork by her Dad of how the media depicted him as a animal or the trope that they could be lazy.. let's say she was shocked by how casual the racist beliefs were.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-08T11:50:59-07:00","id":1563918,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1563916#post1563916\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Irish people as you mentioned were seen as subhuman thugs who were denied employment during the 19th century and even barely a century their was still strong hatred for them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unfortunately you're very wrong in thinking it is in the past.<br /> <br /> Neither the prejudice, the extremes it can get to or even the bad jokes vanished. They moved around, but are still a long way from losing space enough to be treated like that.<br /> <br /> Today the Irish are still regularly targeted by policies or rumors that affect their employment and even health services. This isn't a universal thing, but still happens in the US and is a daily issue in the UK.<br /> <br /> By the way, the reason why the English were so extremely good at being evil imperialists during the last 400 years was because they had more than 500 years of experience developing and refining their shit in Ireland, Scotland and Wales.<br /> <br /> Modern Europe in general goes to great lengths to hide in plain sight how much they're horrible monsters with minorities that are actually right there, but whose suffering is turned invisible under the official depiction of national uniformity.<br /> <br /> People lose jobs, housing and even life every day because they're British, Spanish or French, but not the right kind of British, Spanish or French.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-08T12:52:46-07:00","id":1563920,"title":"","content":"I never said it was a thing of the past Montparnasse as racism is alive and well in the 21st century as we have folks spouting the replacement theory and YouTube having channels that are quite open in their bigotry. I learned that some dude called Deranged Doomer is even more hateful then the usual suspects.<br /> <br /> He calls folks like Critical Drinker, Nerdrotic, Geeks and Gamers and Andypants grifters because they are not hateful enough for his tastes. <br /> <br /> Some people at work told me that he was awful and I had to check him out and I wished I didn't as he is way worse than even Ranting For Vengeance or Ryan Kinel.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","user":"Lysander","date":". 09-08-2026, 04:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude1e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-09T11:18:49-07:00","id":1563936,"title":"","content":"I think that the success of Spider Man Brand New Day and the Odyssey have broken the minds of the grifters that in a desperation for a win, that they are praising the film Citizen Vigilante by Ube Boll.<br /> <br /> One of the worst film makers of the early 21st century who didn't care if his film did well or not because he was taking advantage of now closed tax loophole where he would make bank no matter what?<br /> <br /> This is whom they selected along with whatever the Daily Wire comes out as a choice of good quality films? People at work were talking about these films and I couldn't make it through twenty minutes of their respective work as the characters were one dimensional cardboard cutouts and the plot was paper thin and served to dehumanized a segment of the population.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-09T12:29:10-07:00","id":1563938,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1502169-feel-free-to-vent?p=1563936#post1563936\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__doubl