ID information, or credit card data so you can buy games in the future?<br /> <br /> Absolutely, 1,000% <i>FUCK NO!</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude21","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/29027-greathornedratkin","name":"GreatHornedRatkin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar29027_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2026"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"413"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-09-09T21:49:48-07:00","id":1563949,"title":"","content":"Likewise with The Daily Wire doing a similar film with Jonathan Majors as his domestic abuse charges ruined his rising acting career and now he is stuck with doing a film from Ben Shapiro that he wouldn't even look at several years ago.<br /> <br /> On a side note Majors got injured on set because the Daily Wire couldn't be bothered to follow proper safety procedures. The people who handled props and stunt choreography walked off the set when they learned of that and demanded that safety procedures be followed.<br /> <br /> There response was that they don't listen to communists, I didn't know that providing a safe work environment was a communist notion. We have seen what happens when safety procedures are not followed with the tragic events of Rust, The original Crow and the Twilight Zone movie being the most notable.<br /> <br /> The sad fact is that the entertainment industry will look the other way when it comes to things. They're willing to work with Roman Polanski, Woody Allen Bill Cosby and Harvey Weinstein despite the terrible things they did.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":27361,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpa